== Trivia ==

* Upgraded Astro Duchess wasn't uncovered on update day of the [[RNG Update]]. It was instead recently discovered on December 24th of 2024 a couple weeks past that update (as far as I know) by a user named 420blazes and uploaded by ManofTaj.
* As of writing this, December 24th, 2024, the Upgraded Astro Duchess is currently the strongest toilet by far, although having half the HP of [[The Mothership]], and not having any immunities (TBA,) it has a way faster movement speed than [[The Mothership]].
* She is so small for an unknown reason...
* She was discovered by Manoftaj.

